.TH "PIP-HASH" "1" "Aug 05, 2026" "26.2" "pip"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pip-hash \- description of pip hash command
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Compute a hash of a local package archive.
.sp
These can be used with \-\-hash in a requirements file to do repeatable
installs.

.SH "نحوه استفاده (USAGE)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
python \-m pip hash [options] <file> ...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-a, \-\-algorithm <algorithm>
The hash algorithm to use: one of sha256, sha384, sha512
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_ALGORITHM\fP)
.UNINDENT

.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
pip developers
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
